            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "dmc"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe!!! My daughter and I even made It on a cloudy day and it turned out perfect. It is very soft and light. It could be called brown sugar divinity. If you are looking for the other type of sea foam candy you might try a recipe on this site called sponge candy. But this is exactly what I was looking for and I love it!!!",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-30T16:09:44.440Z"
          },
          {
