            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cuda1570"
            },
            "reviewBody": "a little hard to get it to 260 on my flat top stove because of heating element turning on and off but turned out great. Make sure you have a stand mixer very helpful.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-05T14:31:54.527Z"
          },
          {
