            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SMCHUGH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A welcome change from the finicky egg-white version. Too much or too little corn syrup will alter the result. Always make sure your measuring vessel is clean and dry; fat will sack ya. I pour the candy on to a silpat mat. No sticking. Can also top with room temperature chocolate chips if you don't want to go through the hassle of dipping.",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-26T15:25:38.660Z"
